OL,3,GNEWSAFrasier star Jane Leeves reflects 
OL,4,Aon Sussex roots                        
OL,6,FFrasier actress Jane Leeves says       
OL,7,Freturning to Sussex where she grew up  
OL,8,Ffeels like "coming home".              
OL,10,FLeeves, who played Daphne Moon in the  
OL,11,FAmerican sitcom, told the BBC how she  
OL,12,Fwent to Chequer Mead School, Sackville 
OL,13,FSchool and Bush Davies School of       
OL,14,FTheatre Arts in East Grinstead.        
OL,16,FThe actress, who now lives in the US,  
OL,17,Fsaid: "That's the great thing. It      
OL,18,Falways feels like I'm coming home.     
OL,20,F"I just get to be me and I get to go to
OL,21,Fthe grocery store and help Mum with the
OL,22,Fwashing-up."                           
